# Farfalle Integration

## Farfalle Components (expected)
- Orchestrator: intent routing, tool planner (chain-of-thought hidden)
- Tools Layer: HTTP adapters to CRM endpoints
- Providers: LLMs (OpenAI/Anthropic/Azure), embeddings (optional)
- Webchat UI: Streaming chat interface

## CRM Adapter
- Base URL: https://<site>/api/method/
- Auth: service account cookie + CSRF token; retry on 401 by re-login
- Adapter Methods:
  - list_docs → crm.api.doc.get_data
  - get_doc → frappe.client.get
  - insert_doc → crm.api.doc.insert
  - set_value → crm.api.doc.set_value
  - add_comment → crm.api.comment.add_comment
  - email_draft/send → crm.api.agent.run
  - import_rows/job_status/autogenerate_mapping → crm.api.etl.*

## Streaming Answers
- Execute tools first; synthesize concise answer with citations (links to /app/...)
- For long ops, stream partials and post final summary when job completes

## Context Grounding
- Seed system prompt with CRM domain: roles, DocTypes, field names
- Optional RAG over recent Communications/Notes using CRM endpoints

## Security & Roles
- Map Farfalle user → CRM role set; enforce at tool layer
- Log every tool call with user, doctype, action, args hash

## Deployment
- Host Farfalle separately; allow origin(s) in Frappe CORS if needed
- Embed webchat at /crm/ai or link from sidebar